// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 05-statements/leading_local_comparison_conditional_neg_missing_else.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// A leading-local comparison conditional requires an explicit else: without a
// second arm the body has no total return, so the ownership surface fails the
// shape closed and the checker drains it as ZOM4099.

// CHECK: Error [ZOM4099]: this function body uses a construct the compiler cannot generate code for yet
// CHECK:   --> conformance/05-statements/leading_local_comparison_conditional_neg_missing_else.zom:1:1
